[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SRS014
TITLE: Refuse operation outside the performance assumptions and the checked envelope
STATEMENT: >>>
The Tower CSCI shall read the configured maximum runways, aircraft, and neighbors and shall refuse to start control when any of those limits exceeds 4 runways, 8 aircraft, or 2 neighbors, or when the loaded picture already exceeds the limit. It shall also refuse a new aircraft that would exceed the aircraft limit. Acceptance is a TOML file with 5 runways that does not start, and an airport at the aircraft limit that refuses one more aircraft.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The TLC check is finite. The software must not be operated as if the proof were unbounded.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007
- TYPE: File
  PATH: apps/atc_tower/src/atc_bounds.erl
